# Deny everything, then explicitly allow the files needed by the runtime dashboard.
# Git history, local DVC stores, virtualenvs and other development-only content stay out.
*
!src/
!src/**
!configs/
!configs/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!requirements.txt
!pyproject.toml
!artifacts/
!artifacts/**
!data/
!data/**
!docker/
!docker/**
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/**
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
